  m_text: "<b>Exercise \xB7 Write</b>\n\n<b>Task:</b>\n1. Read the two Toolbox triggers beside this stand, CollisionTrigger and KeyTrigger.\n2. Copy TriggerTemplate.cs as FallTrigger.cs and rename the class. Rename onSomething to onFall, and make it fire when the object is below 1 m.\n3. Add it to Ball E4. In On Fall, choose Lamp E4 \u203A GameObject.SetActive, tick the box, and press Play."
