    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Unity calls OnTriggerExit when a collider leaves. There AreaTrigger checks the tag again and fires onExit. On Zone 5, On Enter calls Door 5 \u203A Door.Open and On Exit calls Door 5 \u203A Door.Close. AreaTrigger also counts: objectsInside goes up by one (++) on entering, and down by one (--) on leaving.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You tick Trigger Only Once on Zone 5. Visitor 5 walks in, out, and in again. Is Door 5 open or closed after the second entry?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play, select Zone 5, and watch Objects Inside as Visitor 5 walks in and out.\n2. Read On Enter and On Exit below it.\n3. Tick Trigger Only Once, and watch Door 5."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
