      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'OnTriggerEnter is one of Unity''s own methods. Unity calls it when another collider enters this object''s collider. Two things are needed: one of the two colliders has Is Trigger on, and at least one of the two objects has a Rigidbody. Here Zone 1 is the trigger, and Visitor 1 has a kinematic Rigidbody.


    <b>Predict:</b> Visitor 1 walks into the zone and out again. Does a line appear in the Console when it walks out?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Press Play and open the Console.

    2. Watch the Console as Visitor 1 walks in and out.

    3. Select Zone 1, untick Is Trigger on its Box Collider, and watch again.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
