  m_text: "AreaTrigger is the trigger you used in your scene. Its OnTriggerEnter holds the tag check of stand 3, turned around: return stops the method when the tag is wrong. Then it fires its own event: onEnter.Invoke() calls every method in the On Enter list. Here that list holds Door 4 \u203A Door.Open.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Visitor 4 walks out of the zone. Does Door 4 close?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play and watch Door 4 as Visitor 4 enters.\n2. Select Zone 4 and find Door 4 \u203A Door.Open in On Enter.\n3. In Code Watch, find the line onEnter.Invoke()."
